    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.test\n\n### Description\n\nIt would be great to have Neotest support for MiniTest. I tried using [neotest-plenary](https://github.com/nvim-neotest/neotest-plenary?utm_source=chatgpt.com) with mini.test, but I wasn’t able to get it working. Some documentation or guidance would be really helpful.",
