    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\n\nI agree that a dedicated adapter for Neotest would be nice to have, but unfortunately it seems like requiring quite a bit of work and code. The  [parsing tests](https://github.com/nvim-neotest/neotest?tab=readme-ov-file#parsing-tests) stage in particular does not look like an easy task given the flexibility 'mini.test' allows in its tests.\n\nSo I am going to close this as \"not planned to be part of MINI\", but if anyone have aspirations to attempt to write this please feel free to reach out (comment here or start a new discussion) and I'll answer any questions you might have about 'mini.test'.",
